{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Docker for AI Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: Install Docker"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# macOS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "brew install --cask docker"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "open /Applications/Docker.app"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Ubuntu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | sh"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "sudo usermod -aG docker $USER"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Log out and back in for group change to take effect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Verify:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker --version"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker run hello-world"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Install NVIDIA Container Toolkit (Linux with NVIDIA GPU)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "This lets Docker containers access your GPU. macOS and Windows (WSL2) users can skip this; Docker Desktop handles GPU passthrough differently on those platforms."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "distribution=$(. /etc/os-release;echo $ID$VERSION_ID)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "curl -fsSL https://nvidia.github.io/libnvidia-container/gpgkey | sudo gpg --dearmor -o /usr/share/keyrings/nvidia-container-toolkit-keyring.gpg"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "curl -s -L https://nvidia.github.io/libnvidia-container/$distribution/libnvidia-container.list | \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    sed 's#deb https://#deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/nvidia-container-toolkit-keyring.gpg] https://#g' | \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/nvidia-container-toolkit.list"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "sudo apt-get update"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "sudo apt-get install -y nvidia-container-toolkit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "sudo nvidia-ctk runtime configure --runtime=docker"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "sudo systemctl restart docker"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Test GPU access inside a container:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker run --rm --gpus all nvidia/cuda:12.4.1-base-ubuntu22.04 nvidia-smi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "If you see your GPU info, the toolkit is working."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Understand base images"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Choosing the right base image saves hours of debugging."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "nvidia/cuda:12.4.1-devel-ubuntu22.04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  Full CUDA toolkit. Compilers included."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  Use for: building packages that need nvcc (flash-attn, bitsandbytes)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  Size: ~4 GB"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "nvidia/cuda:12.4.1-runtime-ubuntu22.04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  CUDA runtime only. No compilers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  Use for: running pre-built code"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  Size: ~1.5 GB"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "pytorch/pytorch:2.3.1-cuda12.4-cudnn9-runtime"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  PyTorch pre-installed on top of CUDA."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  Use for: skipping the PyTorch install step"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  Size: ~6 GB"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "python:3.12-slim"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  No CUDA. CPU only."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  Use for: inference on CPU, lightweight tools"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  Size: ~150 MB"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: Write a Dockerfile for AI development"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Here is the Dockerfile in `code/Dockerfile`. Walk through it:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```dockerfile"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "FROM nvidia/cuda:12.4.1-devel-ubuntu22.04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "ENV DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "ENV PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    python3.12 \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    python3.12-venv \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    python3.12-dev \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    python3-pip \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    git \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    curl \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    build-essential \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "RUN update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/python python /usr/bin/python3.12 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "RUN python -m pip install --no-cache-dir --upgrade pip setuptools wheel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "RUN python -m pip install --no-cache-dir \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    torch==2.3.1 \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    torchvision==0.18.1 \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    torchaudio==2.3.1 \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "RUN python -m pip install --no-cache-dir \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    numpy \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    pandas \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    scikit-learn \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    matplotlib \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    jupyter \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    transformers \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    datasets \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    accelerate \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    safetensors"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "WORKDIR /workspace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "VOLUME [\"/workspace\", \"/models\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "EXPOSE 8888"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "CMD [\"python\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Build it:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker build -t ai-dev -f phases/00-setup-and-tooling/07-docker-for-ai/code/Dockerfile ."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "This takes a while the first time (downloading CUDA base image + PyTorch). Subsequent builds use cached layers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Run it:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker run --rm -it --gpus all \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    -v $(pwd):/workspace \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    -v ~/models:/models \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ai-dev python -c \"import torch; print(f'PyTorch {torch.__version__}, CUDA: {torch.cuda.is_available()}')\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Run Jupyter inside the container:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker run --rm -it --gpus all \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    -v $(pwd):/workspace \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    -v ~/models:/models \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    -p 8888:8888 \\"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ai-dev jupyter notebook --ip=0.0.0.0 --port=8888 --no-browser --allow-root"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 5: Volume mounts for data and models"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Volume mounts are critical for AI work. Without them, your 14 GB model downloads vanish when the container stops."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Mount your code"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "-v $(pwd):/workspace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Mount a shared models directory"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "-v ~/models:/models"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Mount datasets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "-v ~/datasets:/data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Inside your training script, load from the mounted path:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "from transformers import AutoModel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "model = AutoModel.from_pretrained(\"/models/llama-7b\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The model lives on your host filesystem. Rebuild the container as often as you want without re-downloading."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 6: Docker Compose for multi-service AI apps"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "A real RAG application needs an inference server and a vector database. Docker Compose runs both with one command."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "See `code/docker-compose.yml`:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```yaml"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "services:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  ai-dev:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    build:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      context: ."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      dockerfile: Dockerfile"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    deploy:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      resources:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        reservations:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "          devices:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            - driver: nvidia"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "              count: all"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "              capabilities: [gpu]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    volumes:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      - ../../../:/workspace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      - ~/models:/models"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      - ~/datasets:/data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ports:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      - \"8888:8888\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    stdin_open: true"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    tty: true"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    command: jupyter notebook --ip=0.0.0.0 --port=8888 --no-browser --allow-root"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  qdrant:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    image: qdrant/qdrant:v1.12.5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ports:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      - \"6333:6333\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      - \"6334:6334\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    volumes:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      - qdrant_data:/qdrant/storage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "volumes:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  qdrant_data:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Start everything:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "cd phases/00-setup-and-tooling/07-docker-for-ai/code"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker compose up -d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Now your AI dev container can reach the vector database at `http://qdrant:6333` by service name. Docker Compose creates a shared network automatically."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Test the connection from inside the AI container:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "from qdrant_client import QdrantClient"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "client = QdrantClient(host=\"qdrant\", port=6333)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(client.get_collections())"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Stop everything:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker compose down"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Add `-v` to also delete the qdrant volume:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker compose down -v"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 7: Useful Docker commands for AI work"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# List running containers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker ps"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# List all images and their sizes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker images"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Remove unused images (reclaim disk space)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker system prune -a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Check GPU usage inside a running container"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker exec -it <container_id> nvidia-smi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Copy a file from container to host"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker cp <container_id>:/workspace/results.csv ./results.csv"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# View container logs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "docker logs -f <container_id>"
      ]
    },
